      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "Looks a good race for LAWS WARS (1) who resumes off a short spell. Goes well course and distance and this longer trip suits fresh. Last time in Alice was tackling the Guineas. Expected to go close fresh. HIGHSTRUNG (2) was in good form before leading and folding up last time in a run well off best. Has less weight this time and looks a big chance to bounce straight back. MUMMSIE (5) is coming off two runs at Kununurra, placing the latest. Has the ability and can feature in the finish. HIGH AMBITIONS (3) is yet to fire in two runs for the new yard since coming from Victoria. Did run a much better race last time though and is worth keeping safe. BRAZEN SAILOR (4) has placed five of the last six and should be in the finish again.",
